{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT IS ERSATZ?</h2>ERSATZ is a speed focused, hardcore <strong>Action Platformer</strong> with <strong>Rhythm</strong> elements. Featuring a multiple genre <strong>Original Electronic Soundtrack</strong> which dynamically builds and changes based on your progression!<br><br>In ERSATZ, your dash is also your attack, and hitting enemies recharges a dash block instantly. So use it effectively in combination with your slam to chain actions together and speed through 8 challenging and increasingly intense levels as fast as you can. Can you get an S Rank on every level and playstyle?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/703720/extras/1cde3558cc0db2af7e2bff5e698cb1c9.poster.avif?t=1683410682\" width=630 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/703720/extras/1cde3558cc0db2af7e2bff5e698cb1c9.webm?t=1683410682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/703720/extras/1cde3558cc0db2af7e2bff5e698cb1c9.mp4?t=1683410682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>_____________________________________________________________________<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT PEOPLE ARE SAYING ABOUT ERSATZ</h2><i>&quot;It\u2019s the immaculate sound design and tremendous freedom of movement that makes Ersatz so satisfying to play.&quot;</i><br>- <strong>Rock Paper Shotgun</strong><br><br><i>&quot;If you're a fan of seriously good music and challenging platformers, stop right now and go get it. It's very simple to get into, difficult to master and it's a damn treat for the ears.&quot;</i> <br>- <strong>Gaming On Linux</strong><br><br><i>&quot;...Out of every game I've reviewed on this channel and probably every game I will review, this has got to be one of the most overlooked, under rated and underappreciated of them all.&quot;</i><br>- <strong>The Hidden Chest</strong><br><br><i>&quot;For a game made by one person, ERSATZ is one of the most polished games I've ever played!&quot;</i><br>- <strong>Peppage</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/703720/extras/2c7426fcd450c8be4422dcd7843a0794.poster.avif?t=1683410682\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/703720/extras/2c7426fcd450c8be4422dcd7843a0794.webm?t=1683410682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/703720/extras/2c7426fcd450c8be4422dcd7843a0794.mp4?t=1683410682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>_____________________________________________________________________<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Original Soundtrack by game's creator, with genres including:</h2>House, Trance, Synthwave, DnB, Techno &amp; More!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/703720/extras/d54bfb65bd67af5bdcc6fe2c3e58cc69.poster.avif?t=1683410682\" width=630 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/703720/extras/d54bfb65bd67af5bdcc6fe2c3e58cc69.webm?t=1683410682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/703720/extras/d54bfb65bd67af5bdcc6fe2c3e58cc69.mp4?t=1683410682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>_____________________________________________________________________<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Also Inlcuding:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>TYPE BETA &amp; TYPE GAMMA:</strong> Unlockable alternative playstyles with their own times &amp; grades<br></li><li><strong>JOURNEY MODE:</strong> Try &amp; complete all 8 levels as fast as you can. Do it in under 60mins for a special reward. For experts &amp; speedrunners!<br></li><li><strong>INFINITE MODE:</strong> Infinite dash energy, go wild and set crazy times on the mode's own leaderboards!<br></li><li><strong>SYNTH RUSH:</strong> Challenge any individual or ALL of the bosses of ERSATZ against the clock!<br></li><li><strong>STEAM LEADERBOARDS:</strong> See how your times stack up compared to other players all over the world on Windows, Mac &amp; Linux (viewable in game!)<br></li><li><strong>VIBRATION:</strong> With full controller support. Feel your controller vibrate to the beat!</li></ul><br><i>Design, Art, Animation, Programming &amp; Music all by Paris Stalker (that's me!).</i>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"7c175b3636b8c45c21102d42cf5c77db1dabdbd9.jpg","localized_name":"Ready To Run","name":"Ready To Run","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/703720/7c175b3636b8c45c21102d42cf5c77db1dabdbd9.jpg"},{"icon":"dc3e6a67181966ddba7f688082c26cbf4a445c3b.jpg","localized_name":"Synthesize Yourself","name":"Synthesize Yourself","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/703720/dc3e6a67181966ddba7f688082c26cbf4a445c3b.jpg"},{"icon":"4be49dcef163e9879b39b5ef8a13e7d19b6c3512.jpg","localized_name":"Alpha Master","name":"Alpha Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/703720/4be49dcef163e9879b39b5ef8a13e7d19b6c3512.jpg"},{"icon":"17602adf4c026bb363f3afc31426aa38a2d49419.jpg","localized_name":"Beta Master","name":"Beta Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/703720/17602adf4c026bb363f3afc31426aa38a2d49419.jpg"},{"icon":"c4a1f74894e234c87a025ee1459780260c480408.jpg","localized_name":"Gamma Master","name":"Gamma Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/703720/c4a1f74894e234c87a025ee1459780260c480408.jpg"},{"icon":"24814c974c42bc25da961292735e5